ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Hoy es la Caza de Bichos!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Normalmente mi red está vacía,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¡pero hoy quiero atrapar alguno!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Oggi si tiene l'{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Insettomania{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Non sono certo un'abile cacciatrice,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ma darò il meglio di me comunque!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Heute ist das {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Insektikus-Turnier{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ich fange sonst nur selten etwas,
aber heute gebe ich mir extra Mühe.

{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Endlich ist das {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Insektikus-Turnier{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ich war zwar noch nie gut im Fangen
von Insekten, aber ich versuche es!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Sonunda {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Böcek Turnuvası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} zamanı geldi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Böcek yakalamada pek iyi değilim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama bu denememe engel değil!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}¿Cómo irá la Caza de Bichos?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Espero que bien, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}porque quiero ver
cuánta variedad tenemos por aquí!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Che esito avrà la gara odierna
di Insettomania?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}} E soprattutto,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
quali e quanti insetti incontreremo?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Wie wohl das {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Insektikus-Turnier{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
ausgeht?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ich bin jetzt schon
gespannt auf die ganzen Insekten!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hooray!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bug-Off {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}has begun!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I've checked my net for holes, and
I'm ready to go!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}C'est parti pour l'insectosafari,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
youpi ! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Avec ce nouveau filet, la
victoire ne peut pas m'échapper !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ecco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} l'Insettomania è cominciata!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} 
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi sento emozionata e piena di brio
al tempo stesso!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ich bin in Wettkampfstimmung!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ich hab es mir zur Aufgabe gemacht,
heute das größte Insekt zu fangen!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Wo seid ihr denn, kleine Käferchen!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Zirp, zirp, zirp!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}} Zeigt euch mal, ihr
Kleinen!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Have you caught any bugs yet?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}} I've
been swinging my net an awful lot,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but I've mostly been catching grass.

There isn't much time left in the
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bug-Off{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, so{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} give it all you've got!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}We may be rivals in this tournament,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but I always cheer on my friends!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Ce n'est pas le moment de flancher,
on est dans la dernière ligne droite !{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Donne tout ce que tu as !
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ce n'est pas parce qu'on est {{TAG:000E:0006:0C007200690076006100750078000E0072006900760061006C0065007300}}
que je ne peux pas t'encourager !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ne yapacağım?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Böcek Turnuvası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} az
sonra bitecek!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Mükemmel böceği bulmam lazım!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Bu turnuvayı ağım havada bitireceğim.

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Bu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Böcek Turnuvası {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}çok eğlenceliydi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama bitmek üzere!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} Ağaçların hepsini son
bir kez kontrol etmeliyim!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Eh bien,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} la gara è terminata.
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ora dobbiamo solo attendere{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
la cerimonia di premiazione.

DE:
Tja, das Turnier ist jetzt vorbei.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aber dafür fängt bald die
Preisverleihung an!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}L'Insettomania è terminata.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ed ecco che subentra il brivido
dell'attesa per conoscere i risultati!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Böcek Turnuvası {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}başarıyla tamamlandı!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kim kazanırsa kazansın ödül töreni
eğlenceli olacaktır.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Congratulations on your award,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} How did {{TAG:0003:0017:}}you get so
good at catching bugs?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}If you have any good tips,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I hope
you'll share them with me before
the next tournament, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Félicitations per il premio che hai
ricevuto,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} Non sapevo tu
fossi così abile a catturare insetti!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ti sarei oltremodo riconoscente{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
se tu mi potessi dare dei consigli
in vista della prossima gara!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Böcek yakalamada gerçekten harikasın,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} İlk üçe
gireceğini biliyordum!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Congratulations on your award!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
I bet it was almost easy{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} with natural
talent like yours, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Enhorabuena!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Tienes el espíritu de
un{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006100}} auténtic{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} cazador{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006100}} de bichos.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡No esperaba menos de ti!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Félicitations per il tuo premio!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ero certa che lo avresti conseguito,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}con un talento naturale come il tuo!

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Evviva!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi sono impegnata a fondo
per raggiungere questo risultato.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sono contentissima,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ödül alamamana gerçekten şaşırdım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}} Acaba bir böcek ağını
kemirip deldi mi?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Quel dommage que tu n'aies pas
assisté à la remise des prix !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tu nous as manqué !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Schade, dass du nicht bei der
Preisverleihung dabei warst.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du hast uns allen gefehlt!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}À partir de demain, je capture dix
insectes par jour, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}365 jours par an.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pas question de perdre la main !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Da domani{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} si ricomincia con
l'allenamento per l'Insettomania.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Devo mantenermi in forma!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I'm disappointed that the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bug-Off{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
awards ceremony was canceled.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I
wanted to congratulate everyone!

{{TAG:0003:001B:}}So the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bug-Off {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}awards ceremony
has been canceled.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} That's too bad.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I hope they hold one next time!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}La cerimonia di premiazione
dell'Insettomania è stata cancellata.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sigh...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sarà per la prossima volta!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Demek {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Böcek Turnuvası {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ödül töreni iptal
edildi.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Yazık olmuş.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Umarım bir dahaki sefere yapılır!
